---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
// DRAFT: have counsel review before launch (see README).
---
<Base title="Privacy">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Draft. Last updated before launch.</p>
      <p>This page explains, in plain words, what {site.name} collects and why.</p>
      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>This marketing site has no accounts, forms, cookies or tracking scripts. Our hosting provider keeps standard server logs (such as IP address and pages requested) for security.</p>
      <h2>The {site.name} service</h2>
      <p>When you enroll someone, we collect what we need to call them and keep you informed: their name, phone number, city, time zone and the notes you choose to add; your name, email and, optionally, a mobile number for alerts.</p>
      <p>Calls are processed by our voice and telephony providers to hold the conversation, and we keep a transcript and a short summary so you and the care team can see how they're doing.</p>
      <h2>Who can see it</h2>
      <p>Only the people given access to that person's account: family members you add, or the staff of the care provider who enrolled them. Partners who resell {site.name} see billing and counts, not personal details.</p>
      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <p>We don't sell personal information or use it for advertising.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can stop the calls, change what's shared, or ask us to delete a person's data at any time by writing to <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
